{%- comment -%}
  Homepage.

  Deliberately a Liquid template rather than a JSON one. Shopify's GitHub sync
  would not accept templates/index.json into this theme — every other route
  resolved while / returned 404, and /?view=ecomposer proved index routing
  itself was fine — so the homepage is rendered from static sections, which
  are not subject to JSON-template validation. Each section carries its
  content as schema defaults and stays editable in the theme customizer.
{%- endcomment -%}

